stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Handler
  Handler --> Discarded: Result.Failure
  Handler --> Persisting: Result.Success
  Handler --> RolledBack: exception or cancellation
  Persisting --> Committed: save and commit succeed
  Persisting --> Retried: transient before commit
  Retried --> Persisting
  Persisting --> RolledBack: save failure
  Persisting --> Unknown: commit attempted and failed
  RolledBack --> Diagnostic: cleanup failure
  Committed --> [*]
  Discarded --> [*]
  Unknown --> Reconciliation
